    Bug 2016161 - Part 6: De-duplicate MV3 tests from browser_ext_contentScripts_mv3.js into browser_ext_contentScripts.js. r=darktrojan


    The tests in `browser_ext_contentScripts_mv3.js` should test the same as the updated
    Manifest V2 variant in `browser_ext_contentScripts.js`, but with the modularized approach
    it is now much easier to to run all tests in the same file.

    The tests for registering content scripts in the manifest remain and the file is renamed.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D283311

